msgstr "**参考文献**: E. van den Berg, Z. Minev, A. Kandala, and K. Temme, *Probabilistic error cancellation with sparse Pauli-Lindblad models on noisy quantum processors* [arXiv:2201.09866](https://arxiv.org/abs/2201.09866)\n"

